        "multiline-arithmetic-shift",
        "quoted-multiline-arithmetic-shift"
      ],
      "action": "Preserve expansion/command-substitution effects when validating plain assignments; ensure allowed trap operands cannot abort cleanup under nounset; carry lexical arithmetic/quote state across lines or reject unsupported multiline forms before claiming no allocation. Require all five negative fixtures and both complete-gate controls to fail. These cases use direct ordinary shell without eval or hidden sourced-file behavior.",
